{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/f8195188f1cf95079ec9fba20adfce32.poster.avif?t=1770394900\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/f8195188f1cf95079ec9fba20adfce32.webm?t=1770394900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/f8195188f1cf95079ec9fba20adfce32.mp4?t=1770394900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Shadow of the Rift: A Continent's Peace is Shattered</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land of Veridia, blessed with abundant life and rich resources, has known peace for generations. But that peace is shattered. From another dimension, a malevolent entity appears, tearing open dimensional rifts across the continent. From these rifts, it summons hordes of monsters, their minds and bodies twisted and corrupted by its vile magic. In an instant, Veridia is plunged into chaos and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of this turmoil, an ordinary young man from a small village, living a simple life of farming and hunting, awakens a dormant power within. To save Veridia and protect his home, he must take up the sword and accept his new destiny: to stand against this dark force and its legion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the journey to restore peace to the continent of Veridia!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Character, Endless Combat Styles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a single character and freely master multiple combat styles \u2014 melee, ranged, and magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you adventure and wield different weapons, your proficiency grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn proficiency points to unlock and upgrade weapon-specific skills tied to how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/4f1e47998d21d888aeb955b1e6746902.poster.avif?t=1770394900\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/4f1e47998d21d888aeb955b1e6746902.webm?t=1770394900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/4f1e47998d21d888aeb955b1e6746902.mp4?t=1770394900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon-Based Combat &amp; Skill Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your combat style is defined by the weapon you use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon features its own unique skill tree,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the more you use it, the more of its true potential you unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your build to match your playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by freely combining melee, ranged, and magic skills into a combat style that\u2019s truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leveling and Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt monsters to gain levels, and choose which stats to increase as your character grows. You can also upgrade your weapons and armor to make your character much stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/fc0ba484df6b250d49a83ca80efffcf4.poster.avif?t=1770394900\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/fc0ba484df6b250d49a83ca80efffcf4.webm?t=1770394900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/fc0ba484df6b250d49a83ca80efffcf4.mp4?t=1770394900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides the items you get from monsters, you can find different materials in the world. Use them to craft special, rare items to make your character stand out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/d7ed2462114606935b9b84aa3b3033f0.poster.avif?t=1770394900\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/d7ed2462114606935b9b84aa3b3033f0.webm?t=1770394900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/d7ed2462114606935b9b84aa3b3033f0.mp4?t=1770394900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Over Rifts and Expand Your Area</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will appear from things called &quot;Dimensional Rifts.&quot; You can fight to capture these rifts and expand the area you control. Once you capture a rift, you can use it to fast travel around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow and Get Stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to take over enemy land to make your territory bigger, and you\u2019ll also need to defend your areas from enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932010?t=1770394900","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932010?t=1770394900","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/dd30f9dcf2f439217f440a56a2fefca4bef52b1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770394900","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/dd30f9dcf2f439217f440a56a2fefca4bef52b1c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770394900","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/f8195188f1cf95079ec9fba20adfce32.poster.avif?t=1770394900\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/f8195188f1cf95079ec9fba20adfce32.webm?t=1770394900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/f8195188f1cf95079ec9fba20adfce32.mp4?t=1770394900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Shadow of the Rift: A Continent's Peace is Shattered</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land of Veridia, blessed with abundant life and rich resources, has known peace for generations. But that peace is shattered. From another dimension, a malevolent entity appears, tearing open dimensional rifts across the continent. From these rifts, it summons hordes of monsters, their minds and bodies twisted and corrupted by its vile magic. In an instant, Veridia is plunged into chaos and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of this turmoil, an ordinary young man from a small village, living a simple life of farming and hunting, awakens a dormant power within. To save Veridia and protect his home, he must take up the sword and accept his new destiny: to stand against this dark force and its legion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the journey to restore peace to the continent of Veridia!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Character, Endless Combat Styles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a single character and freely master multiple combat styles \u2014 melee, ranged, and magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you adventure and wield different weapons, your proficiency grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn proficiency points to unlock and upgrade weapon-specific skills tied to how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/4f1e47998d21d888aeb955b1e6746902.poster.avif?t=1770394900\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/4f1e47998d21d888aeb955b1e6746902.webm?t=1770394900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/4f1e47998d21d888aeb955b1e6746902.mp4?t=1770394900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon-Based Combat &amp; Skill Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your combat style is defined by the weapon you use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon features its own unique skill tree,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the more you use it, the more of its true potential you unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your build to match your playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by freely combining melee, ranged, and magic skills into a combat style that\u2019s truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leveling and Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt monsters to gain levels, and choose which stats to increase as your character grows. You can also upgrade your weapons and armor to make your character much stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/fc0ba484df6b250d49a83ca80efffcf4.poster.avif?t=1770394900\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/fc0ba484df6b250d49a83ca80efffcf4.webm?t=1770394900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/fc0ba484df6b250d49a83ca80efffcf4.mp4?t=1770394900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides the items you get from monsters, you can find different materials in the world. Use them to craft special, rare items to make your character stand out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/d7ed2462114606935b9b84aa3b3033f0.poster.avif?t=1770394900\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/d7ed2462114606935b9b84aa3b3033f0.webm?t=1770394900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/d7ed2462114606935b9b84aa3b3033f0.mp4?t=1770394900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Over Rifts and Expand Your Area</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will appear from things called &quot;Dimensional Rifts.&quot; You can fight to capture these rifts and expand the area you control. Once you capture a rift, you can use it to fast travel around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow and Get Stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to take over enemy land to make your territory bigger, and you\u2019ll also need to defend your areas from enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["NetOps Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/79b37b8ee78f2481784067be96c58feb32194c76/header.jpg?t=1770394900","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3932010/2007476238/bcb20c3b752638b25c8d180a76e5c27b03dd48c5/1768907399/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768907995","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3932010/2007476238/bcb20c3b752638b25c8d180a76e5c27b03dd48c5/1768907399/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768907995","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3932010/2007476238/bcb20c3b752638b25c8d180a76e5c27b03dd48c5/1768907399/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768907995","id":257268507,"name":"UNSEEN LAND TRAILER","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257268507/961735435a819374d72ad4d89c1b148934a89c9b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768907995"}],"name":"UNSEEN LAND: INTO THE MIST","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","na